ftYaHei","size":10.005999565124512,"resolvedFamily":"Microsoft YaHei"},{"anchor":"text-11","text":":","box":[0.3381164609240568,0.3338910985876013,0.0028871251739246394,0.018529651783130787],"origin":[0.3381164609240568,0.3487148143627025],"font":"ArialMT","size":10.005999565124512,"resolvedFamily":"Arial"},{"anchor":"text-12","text":"领导视察","box":[0.05551091167505203,0.1716641037552445,0.08347007828635315,0.03706111201533565],"origin":[0.05551091167505203,0.20131299054181134],"font":"MicrosoftYaHei-Bold","size":20.01300048828125,"resolvedFamily":"Microsoft YaHei"},{"anchor":"text-13","text":"坚持以人民为中心，不断提升服务质量","box":[0.05551091167505203,0.4316437332718461,0.2484924464970139,0.025931464301215276],"origin":[0.05551091167505203,0.4523889047128183],"font":"MicrosoftYaHei-Bold","size":14.003000259399414,"resolvedFamily":"Microsoft YaHei"},{"anchor":"text-14","text":"王书记强调，事业单位是联系群众的重要纽带。要深入了解群众需求，创","box":[0.05551091167505203,0.4764615094220197,0.33398319769569124,0.018529595269097223],"origin":[0.05551091167505203,0.49128519694010414],"font":"MicrosoftYaHei","size":10.005999565124512,"resolvedFamily":"Microsoft YaHei"},{"anchor":"text-15","text":"新服务方式，提高工作效率，让群众切实感受到事业单位的温度。他特别","box":[0.05551091167505203,0.5031281647858796,0.333982148664281,0.018529595269097223],"origin":[0.05551091167505203,0.5179518523039641],"font":"MicrosoftYaHei","size":10.005999565124512,"resolvedFamily":"Microsoft YaHei"},{"anchor":"text-16","text":"指出，要关注老年人、残疾人等特殊群体的需求，确保服务全面覆盖。","box":[0.05551091167505203,0.5296374285662616,0.3216697623689545,0.018529595269097223],"origin":[0.05551091167505203,0.5444611160843461],"font":"MicrosoftYaHei","size":10.005999565124512,"resolvedFamily":"Microsoft YaHei"},{"anchor":"text-17","text":"加强队伍建设，提升专业能力","box":[0.05551091167505203,0.6024048416702835,0.19005969624500796,0.025931464301215276],"origin":[0.05551091167505203,0.6231500131112558],"font":"MicrosoftYaHei-Bold","size":14.003000259399414,"resolvedFamily":"Microsoft YaHei"},{"anchor":"text-18","text":